\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bcc3304 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bcc3304\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70c8d54 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"70c8d54\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Advanced Feed Optimization, Tailored to Your Needs<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2aeeabc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2aeeabc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some retailers need more than off-the-shelf solutions. If you&#8217;re managing complex catalogs, supporting multiple regions, or scaling across multiple sales channels, FeedOps can scope a custom solution aligned to your structure, goals, and workflow.<\/span><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether it&#8217;s <strong>high-volume SKU optimization<\/strong>, Local Inventory Ads, marketplace feeds, or team-based governance\u2014we\u2019ll price it fairly and execute it right.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5da8c80 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5da8c80\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd762f9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bd762f9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6a1888 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a6a1888\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8220;In just one month, Organic Shopping revenue jumped 139%. The momentum is real.&#8221;<\/span><\/i><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8a045c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f8a045c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Head of Marketing, Auto One<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84dec7b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"84dec7b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"383\" height=\"131\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/auto-one-logo.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4782\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/auto-one-logo.png 383w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/auto-one-logo-300x103.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 383px) 100vw, 383px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f806750 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f806750\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e88a552 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e88a552\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b156654 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b156654\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Request Your Tailored FeedOps Proposal<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c236e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c236e8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Tell us about you so we can tailor the experience to you.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc0e52e elementor-widget elementor-widget-hubspot-form\" data-id=\"dc0e52e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"hubspot-form.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\twindow.hsFormsOnReady = window.hsFormsOnReady || [];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\twindow.hsFormsOnReady.push(()=>{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thbspt.forms.create({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tportalId: 20083726,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tformId: \"f9cb0a6e-95f4-42f9-946f-00fef06f87e7\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttarget: \"#hbspt-form-1780280680000-8843551819\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tregion: \"na1\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})});\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"hbspt-form\" id=\"hbspt-form-1780280680000-8843551819\"><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b564ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3b564ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0Prefer to talk first? <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/contact-us\/\">Contact us<\/a><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88d3f65 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"88d3f65\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97d0e17 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"97d0e17\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29346a7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"29346a7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b0ff25e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b0ff25e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Is a Custom Proposal Right for You?<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You may benefit from a tailored proposal if you:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Optimize more than <\/span><b>50,000 SKUs per month<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Manage catalogs that update <\/span><b>daily or in real time<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Operate in <\/span><b>multiple currencies or languages<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sell across several <\/span><b>ad channels<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (Google, Meta, Microsoft) or <\/span><b>marketplaces<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (Amazon, eBay)<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Require <\/span><b>advanced feed rules<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, <\/span><b>multi-currency support<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, or <\/span><b>order sync<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Work with <\/span><b>internal teams or agencies<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> that need shared access or governance<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Need to optimize feed data for <\/span><b>SEO or website enrichment<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Require <\/span><b>large-scale automated RSA generation<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for Google and Microsoft<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Have <\/span><b>complex first-party data sync<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> needs (CRM, CDP, ERP, etc.)<br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019ll collaborate with your team to define what matters most\u2014then deliver a scoped proposal aligned to your business and performance goals.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If none of the above apply, you may not need a custom quote\u2014<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/pricing\/\">White\u2011Glove Essentials plan<\/a> and get started today.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-841a88e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"841a88e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8beb78 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a8beb78\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7a387d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c7a387d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>What Happens Next<\/b><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li><b> Initial Review<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 We\u2019ll review your submission and get back to you within 1 business day.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><b>Tailored Proposal<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 You\u2019ll receive a scoped plan with pricing, based on your data and goals.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br>Let us show you how optimized product data can improve visibility, reduce wasted ad spend, and unlock scalable, omnichannel growth\u2014without adding complexity.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Request a Custom Proposal Advanced Feed Optimization, Tailored to Your Needs Some retailers need more than off-the-shelf solutions. If you&#8217;re managing complex catalogs, supporting multiple regions, or scaling across multiple sales channels, FeedOps can scope a custom solution aligned to your structure, goals, and workflow. \u00a0 Whether it&#8217;s high-volume SKU optimization, Local Inventory Ads, marketplace [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":5041,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5079","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>FeedOps Custom Proposal | Tailored AI Product Feed Optimization<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Request a FeedOps custom proposal for advanced feed o